; Recovery: which transcript is which permaflow's, read from the
; transcripts themselves, after the Flow Nexus has lost it.
;
; The one input is a Recovery: the transcript root, how deep under it
; session files are read, where a session's start, its session id and a
; record's time stand in a session file, and the marks of its identity
; lines. Nothing is read from the environment and nothing of these is
; written in the code.
;
; A session file is a file whose name ends in the FileSuffix, standing at
; most Depth directories below the root. Its identity is read from its
; records whose RecordField holds a KindField equal to SnapshotKind: each
; string under that record's PromptField is read line by line, the line
; opening with the AddressMark giving the Address, the line opening with
; the FlowIdMark the flow id the launcher wrote. The last such record with
; both holds for the file, and its SessionField is the file's session id.
; The file's time is the TimeField of its last record that carries one as
; text; times are compared as text.
;
; A flow is a flow id: one session, one file. A file whose flow id is not
; the start of its session id is Mismatched and not placed. An Address has
; a chain of flows, ordered by their files' times: the newest is its
; current flow, its one Bind; the older ones are Past. Contested is a flow
; id two files claim, or the newest flows of an Address whose times do not
; order them; neither binds. Unidentified is a session file no identity
; could be read from.
;
; Each output line is one Placement. Bind is the meta Signal's Bind input
; (meta-signal-flow 0.95.0), printed as flow-meta reads it.

Library
[ flow_ethos:Address
  flow_ethos:FlowId
  signal_flow:TranscriptPath ]
[ TranscriptRoot.String
  Depth.Integer
  FileSuffix.String
  RecordField.String
  KindField.String
  SnapshotKind.String
  PromptField.String
  SessionField.String
  TimeField.String
  AddressMark.String
  FlowIdMark.String
  SessionId.String
  SessionShape.{ FileSuffix RecordField KindField SnapshotKind PromptField SessionField TimeField }
  IdentityMarks.{ AddressMark FlowIdMark }
  Recovery.{ TranscriptRoot Depth SessionShape IdentityMarks }
  Contest.[ SharedFlow.{ FlowId Vector<TranscriptPath> }
            Unordered.{ Address Vector<TranscriptPath> } ]
  ; The printed form of every output line; Bind is declared here alone.
  Placement.[ Bind.{ Address TranscriptPath }
              Past.{ Address FlowId TranscriptPath }
              Contested.Contest
              Mismatched.{ TranscriptPath FlowId Option<SessionId> }
              Unidentified.TranscriptPath ] ]
[]
[]
